        "original_id": "3691511f-13ce-5466-8cb8-ad59affb54d8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Fade to Black, Flashback, The Way\n- Companies: Delphine Software International, Delphine Software, Electronic Arts, U.S. Gold, Sunsoft, Puzzling Dream, PlayWay\n- Concepts: action-adventure games, cinematic platform games, puzzle platformers, science fiction games\n\nFacts:\n- Flashback is a 1992 science fiction cinematic platform game developed by Delphine Software of France.\n- Flashback was released in the United States as Flashback: The Quest for Identity.\n- Flashback was published by U.S. Gold in the United States and Europe, and by Sunsoft in Japan.\n- Fade to Black is an action-adventure game developed by Delphine Software International and published by Electronic Arts.\n- The Way is a 2D puzzle platformer made by Puzzling Dream and published by PlayWay.\n- The Way was inspired by Another World, Heart of Darkness, and Flashback.",
